carry the brief, not erase it"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"An AI-assisted distribution workflow is only as coherent as the information it preserves between steps. A research note becomes a brief, a brief becomes a script, and a script becomes a publishing request. At each handoff, the original audience problem can disappear beneath generic instructions to make the content engaging. Keep the account promise, evidence, intended action and prohibited claims attached to the asset. The machine should receive enough context to reject a slick but irrelevant draft, not merely enough words to fill a template."}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"editorial-diagram diagram-flow","children":[["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mono acid","children":"THE IDEA, UNPACKED"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Preserve intent through the pipeline"}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"diagram-items","children":[["$","li","Brief",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Brief"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Audience, promise, evidence and limits."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Asset",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Asset"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A version that can be reviewed against the brief."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Release",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Release"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"An authorised action with a traceable result."}],false]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"diagram-caption","children":"Editorial model: a way to reason about the process, not measured platform results."}]]}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"Separate creative suggestions from operational authority. A model can propose an angle without permission to spend money, publish or alter an account. Give each stage a clear output and a review condition. Record which version was accepted and why, then compare the published result with that approved version. The useful ambition is an operation that retains judgement while reducing repetitive work. If nobody can explain why a particular post exists or who authorised its release, the workflow has gained speed while losing its editorial centre."}]]]}],false,false,"$L19","$undefined",false,"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}],"$L1e"]}]
16:["$","section",null,{"className":"related-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":["$","h2",null,{"children":"Other currents."}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-grid","children":[["$","$L1f","080",{"a":{"id":"080","slug":"agentic-agd","category":"machines","term":"Agentic AGD","kind":"guide","image":"agentic-agd","media":"$1:props:children:1:props:next:media","en":{"title":"A distribution agent is not a talking calendar.","dek":"Agentic AGD coordinates recurring decisions across accounts, content, markets and experiments."},"readingMinutes":2},"lang":"en"}],["$","$L1f","100",{"a":{"id":"100","slug":"agent-audit-log","category":"machines","term":"Agent audit log","kind":"guide","image":"agent-audit-log","media":{"kind":"photograph","src":"/images/editorial/agent-audit-log.jpg","width":1280,"height":1420,"alt":{"en":"Labeled decks of punched computer cards packed into a storage box."},"credit":"ArnoldReinhold","provenance":"Wikimedia Commons photograph. Resized and JPEG-compressed from the source photograph. Original source SHA1: b8ab119149236be900f3661af56ce7f925753d6f.","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PunchCardDecks.agr.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5"},"en":{"title":"The log that makes tomorrow understandable.","dek":"An agent log connects intent, tool, result and next decision."},"readingMinutes":2},"lang":"en"}],["$","$L1f","001",{"a":{"id":"001","slug":"distribution-is-the-moat","category":"doctrine","term":"Account-Generated Distribution","kind":"essay","image":"distribution-is-the-moat","media":{"kind":"illustration","src":"/images/iceberg.jpg","width":1536,"height":1024,"alt":{"en":"Night iceberg with a green submerged mass, a metaphor for unseen distribution."},"credit":"THE ORGANIC CLUB Studio","provenance":"Original AI-generated editorial illustration created for this publication on September 8, 2026. Not a documentary photograph.","s